#: aurora/settingsapp/ai.py:98
msgid "Bigger models answer better but need more memory. This computer has {ram:.0f} GB."
msgstr "Größere Modelle antworten besser, brauchen aber mehr Arbeitsspeicher. Dieser Computer hat {ram:.0f} GB."

#: aurora/settingsapp/ai.py:103
